:: Gabe Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> if he wants to go to the park with you and he gives an amused smirk. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure thing, just don’t expect me to run around giggling like your little friends.”</span> He leaves, messing up your hair. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You know, I had a girl ask me out on a date to the park the other day.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> says with a smirk. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But she wasn’t my type. Bit too nerdy, you know? But her glasses were cute on her though.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> smiles, proud of his ability to pick up girls without trying, as you roll your eyes.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Gabe",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Mad",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Smirk",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Praise Gabe<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You praise <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> for his datability, saying that and good looks must run in the family. <span style="color:LightGreen">You’re sure by your age you’ll be getting just as many dates as him or more.</span> 
        <<if $BedWetter == 1>>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I’m sure, though maybe work on not pissing the bed every night before inviting a girl over, hm?”</span>
        <<elseif $Player.Traits.includes("Childish")>>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I’m sure. Though maybe you should put your toys and stuffed animals away before inviting any girls over, hm?”</span>
        <<elseif $Player.Height == "Short" or $Player.Height == "Shorter">>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I’m sure. Grow a few more inches, in a few places, and MAYBE you’ll start attracting girls.”</span>
        <<else>>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I’m sure. Though I get the feeling girls won’t be the main thing you’ll be attracting.”</span>
        <</if>>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You blush at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s words, playfully hitting him as he runs ahead laughing.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Gabe Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Tease him<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You sarcastically praise <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>, saying that you bet he gets ALL the girls in his class. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> almost takes your compliment… <span style="color:LightGreen">until he remembers the <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“all boys school”</span> thing.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You little shit.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> says, picking you up and throwing you over his shoulder. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just for that, you’re going into the pond.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You laugh and cry out as he carries you just short of the park’s pond, only a few feet shy of an uncomfortable dip. Would have been worth it, even if he did actually do it. Thankfully, it was just a threat.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Gabe Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>